#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :ref:`Based on Rules <inventory/"
"shipping/rules>`, :ref:`Fixed Price <inventory/shipping/fixed>`, "
"or :ref:`Pickup in store <inventory/shipping/pickup>` if the shiping method "
