#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:105
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Customize Pickup Sites`, select the shipping method "
"or click :guilabel:`New` to create a new one and :ref:`configure <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-delivery-method>` the fields. Make sure "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` field is set to :guilabel:`Pickup in store`."
